FOUTPUT,BDCONV	/FLOATING OUTPUT
FINPUT,	DBCONV	/FLOATING INPUT
COMBUF,	COMEIN	/COMMAND BUFFER`START
CFRS,	FRST	/ADDRESS OF DUMMY LINE.
