	GETC		/MOVE PAST EXTRA CHARACTER
EVAL,	DCA LASTOP	/EVAUATION CONTROLLER (CHECKPOINT ?)
	TESTC		/TEST CHARACTER AND IGNORE SPACES
	JMP ETERM1	/TERMIOATION
	JMP ENUM	/NUMBER
